@startuml state-dispatch
!include _style.iuml
title State machine — Dispatch order (services/dispatch.py DISPATCH_TRANSITIONS)

[*] --> REQUESTED : create(team, instructions)\n/ reserve resources (row lock)

REQUESTED : after(DISPATCH_ACK_TIMEOUT) / record DISPATCH_ESCALATED
REQUESTED --> ACKNOWLEDGED : acknowledge
REQUESTED --> REJECTED : reject(reason)\n/ release resources
ACKNOWLEDGED --> DISPATCHED : progress(EN_ROUTE)
ACKNOWLEDGED --> FAILED : fail(reason)\n/ release resources
DISPATCHED : progress(ON_SCENE | DELAYED | UPDATE) / record progress
DISPATCHED : teamRequest(capability) / open team request
DISPATCHED --> COMPLETED : complete\n/ release resources, notify dispatcher
DISPATCHED --> FAILED : fail(reason)\n/ release resources

REJECTED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]
COMPLETED --> [*]

note bottom of COMPLETED
  An event that does not match the current state
  (for example a late acknowledgement) is answered
  409, audited and never applied.
end note
@enduml
